      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="3d1d8f73-0e88-4ead-1003-de7ef063691f" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left">Questions we get about <span class="gradient-text">online ordering:</span></h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_3d1d8f73-0e88-4ead-1003-de7ef0636924-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="3d1d8f73-0e88-4ead-1003-de7ef0636924" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Do we need to reconfigure the menu on each tablet?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The pad automatically retrieves your register's settings: menu, floor plan, payment methods, and PIN codes. Every update is instantly synced to all the pads in the restaurant.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3d1d8f73-0e88-4ead-1003-de7ef063692f-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="3d1d8f73-0e88-4ead-1003-de7ef063692f" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can the pad and the drum set be used at the same time on the same table?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Both update the same table in real time. Whatever is added to the cash register appears on the PAD, and vice versa. Multiple servers can work on the same table simultaneously.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3d1d8f73-0e88-4ead-1003-de7ef0636944-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="3d1d8f73-0e88-4ead-1003-de7ef0636944" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does the "delivery to the kitchen" service work?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">A custom dispatch order can be set for each product. Upon validation, each workstation receives instructions on what to process immediately and what to prepare next. The server sends each subsequent order by clicking “Next.” Only the relevant workstation receives the information.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-ae316c34-d313-0ff1-ba84-1c73e3b1e391-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="ae316c34-d313-0ff1-ba84-1c73e3b1e391" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does the tablet work if the restaurant loses its Internet connection?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, in offline mode. A local server installed in the restaurant keeps the pad and the POS system in sync. Ordering and sending orders to the kitchen remain operational. Only external services are suspended: digital ordering, online payments, and back-office reporting.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-f1317ca8-7ed9-af28-1b2b-002df5aa1ba2-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="f1317ca8-7ed9-af28-1b2b-002df5aa1ba2" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Is the pad durable?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. The tablet is a proven professional-grade device with a reinforced casing and a scratch- and drop-resistant screen, designed to be cleaned and disinfected between shifts. It’s built to withstand the pace of busy periods.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_61796b9d-458d-939d-b6f8-b3548c7c2d9a-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="61796b9d-458d-939d-b6f8-b3548c7c2d9a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Isn't the pad's size too bulky when in use?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">On the contrary, that's exactly what sets it apart from a traditional tablet. With its pocket-sized design, it can be held and used with one hand and easily slips into a pocket.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-cb3a2e47-38a7-e305-cbdc-ee09be817c57-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="cb3a2e47-38a7-e305-cbdc-ee09be817c57" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Are the ordering and payment processes intuitive?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, the interface mirrors the workflow of your register: a server—even a seasonal one—can be up and running in just a few minutes, without any tedious training. Taking orders, sending them to the kitchen, and processing payments all flow seamlessly in a single workflow, without ever having to switch devices or re-enter information.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-baf66a23-0ce0-3c31-b527-605266468141-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="baf66a23-0ce0-3c31-b527-605266468141" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What is the battery life and range of the pad?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The pad can handle a full shift on a single charge. In terms of range, it works anywhere your network has coverage (dining room, patio, upper floor) and stays continuously synchronized via the restaurant’s local server, even without an Internet connection.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_8c033760-2065-dfad-b079-4f93a54a3f1a-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="8c033760-2065-dfad-b079-4f93a54a3f1a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What types of payment does the pad accept?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The pad supports contactless payments, credit card swiping, meal cards, split bills, and multiple payments.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_16cba522-2589-0a59-7ca8-d69f1c5114a0-40fe1d2e" data-w-id="16cba522-2589-0a59-7ca8-d69f1c5114a0" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can you accept payments directly from the pad?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. The server takes the order, sends it to the kitchen, and processes the payment at the table, without ever going through the register.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
